// PVSystem and Storage (after IEEE13_CDPSM, IEEE9500, IEEE123): a 3-phase PV at irradiance 0.8 and a 2-phase
// s1s2 PV at 0.208 kV on a center-tap secondary; a 1-phase leg; a 1-phase wye PV on the primary (ratedU x sqrt 3);
// a delta PV; a kVA-capped PV (Pmpp 1200 on 1000 kVA); one below %Cutout; a negative pf; kvar. Batteries charging,
// discharging and idling (State), state=charge kW=150 (it discharges) and state=charge kW=-0.0 (it idles), a
// kVA-capped battery, %stored, delta.
Clear
New Circuit.atom basekv=4.16 bus1=sourcebus pu=1.0 MVAsc3=20000 MVAsc1=21000
New Line.l1 bus1=sourcebus bus2=b1 phases=3 r1=0.1 x1=0.2 r0=0.3 x0=0.6 length=1 units=kft
New Transformer.t phases=3 buses=[b1 b2] kVs=[4.16 0.48] kVAs=[2000 2000] xhl=5
New XfmrCode.ct phases=1 windings=3 kVs=[2.4 0.12 0.12] kVAs=[25 25 25]
New Transformer.ct XfmrCode=ct buses=[b1.2 house.1.0 house.0.2]
New PVSystem.School phases=3 bus1=b2 kV=0.48 kVA=300 irrad=0.8 Pmpp=300 PF=1
New PVSystem.House phases=2 bus1=house.1.2 kv=0.208 conn=wye kVA=5 irrad=0.8 Pmpp=5 PF=1
New PVSystem.leg phases=1 bus1=house.2 kv=0.12 kVA=3.3 Pmpp=3
New PVSystem.primary phases=1 bus1=b1.3 kv=2.4 kVA=120 Pmpp=120
New PVSystem.dpv bus1=b2 kv=0.48 conn=delta kVA=60 Pmpp=50
New PVSystem.farm bus1=b1 kv=4.16 kVA=1000 Pmpp=1200
New PVSystem.dim bus1=b2 kv=0.48 kVA=12 Pmpp=10 irradiance=0.1
New PVSystem.lead bus1=b2 kv=0.48 kVA=12 Pmpp=10 pf=-0.9
New PVSystem.vars bus1=b2 kv=0.48 kVA=12 Pmpp=10 kvar=3
New Storage.School phases=3 bus1=b2 kV=0.48 kWRated=100 kWhRated=200 kWhStored=100 state=discharging
New Storage.BatIdle phases=3 bus1=b2 kV=0.48 kWRated=100 kWhRated=200 kWhStored=100 state=idling
New Storage.House phases=2 bus1=house.1.2 kv=0.208 conn=wye kWRated=5 kWhRated=13.5 kWhStored=5 state=charging
New Storage.ess phases=3 bus1=b2 kVA=250 kV=0.480 conn=delta
~ kWrated=250 kWHrated=500 %reserve=30
~ state=charge kW=150 PF=1
New Storage.b123 phases=1 bus1=b1.1 kVA=125 kV=2.4
~ kWrated=125 kWHrated=500 %reserve=30 %stored=60
~ state=charge kW=-0.0 PF=1
